9,0:00:40.97,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Karaoke    KaitouYahikoDialogue: 5,0:00:42.47,0:00:47.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality Control     Feeso    Pepperjack    ZenefDialogue: 6,0:00:42.47,0:00:47.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality Control     Feeso    Pepperjack    ZenefDialogue: 5,0:00:55.07,0:01:02.41,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                   HaleeDialogue: 6,0:00:55.07,0:01:02.41,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                   HaleeDialogue: 5,0:01:02.41,0:01:06.41,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Timing    PhosCityDialogue: 6,0:01:02.41,0:01:06.41,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Timing    PhosCityDialogue: 5,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.78,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle Editing     JT-421Dialogue: 6,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.78,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle Editing     JT-421Dialogue: 5,0:01:38.90,0:01:43.07,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Translation     Crunchyroll     Gaijin     IbfinityDialogue: 6,0:01:38.90,0:01:43.07,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Translation     Crunchyroll     Gaijin     IbfinityDialogue: 5,0:02:12.65,0:02:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who found him first?  Please let us question them!Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.60,0:02:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are there any suspects?Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.95,0:02:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could this be connected to the Franky House's destruction?Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.58,0:02:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we get a statement?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any new developments?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.54,0:02:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear about what happened at Shipyard Island?Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he really dead?Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky must have done it!Dialogue: 5,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This happened because they let him have free rein! Dialogue: 5,0:02:34.47,0:02:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it could very well be that those pirates at the shipyard did it.Dialogue: 5,0:02:45.89,0:02:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is where you guys were.Dialogue: 5,0:02:51.18,0:02:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We went to the trouble of getting a room,  but no one's even using it.Dialogue: 5,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess none of you could sleep, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over there.Dialogue: 5,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go, Sanji?Dialogue: 5,0:03:11.32,0:03:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I kept a lookout at the rocky cape all night...Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.51,0:03:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just in case Robin-chan came back.Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.60,0:03:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she went...  without saying a word. Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.19,0:03:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna wander  around town looking for her today.Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we'll find her. Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows?Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.43,0:03:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have specific places in mind to check,Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.24,0:03:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but in any case,  she's gotta be here somewhere. Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.12,0:03:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If something happens, we should rendezvous here.Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.31,0:03:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help you look for her.Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.59,0:03:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Well, then.Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.72,0:04:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san !Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got bad news.Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.51,0:04:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole town is talking about it!Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.52,0:04:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Last night, Iceburg-san  from the shipyard was...Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.73,0:04:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san was shot at his home?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut the crap!Dialogue: 5,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Is he dead?! – Slow down!Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.78,0:04:26.29,Main-207+,,200,200,0,,– He isn't the type to make enemies of people!  – Hold on a sec. Calm down, Paulie!Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.29,0:04:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.00,0:04:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, Iceburg-san was found covered in blood  in his room this morning.Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.25,0:04:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He fell into a coma and hasn't come to.Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.26,0:04:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, just get to the office now!Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulu! Seen Paulie?Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.64,0:04:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just called him.  He'll arrive shortly. Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That so?Dialogue: 5,0:04:53.79,0:04:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reporters are making  one helluva hullabaloo outside. Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.40,0:05:02.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty ironic considering we're  about as out-of-the-loop as they are.Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.75,0:05:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They tore up the whole office,Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.05,0:05:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's no sign  that any money or valuables were pilfered.Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.49,0:05:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So if it wasn't a robbery, why would someone  just waltz in and gun down Iceburg-san ?Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.12,0:05:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.Dialogue: 5,0:05:15.79,0:05:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, this is a disaster. Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole city is in a panic.Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.42,0:05:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If something happens to him,  Galley-La Company,Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.15,0:05:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as well as Water Seven, will be finished.Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.60,0:05:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor, how is he?Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.16,0:05:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm...Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.00,0:05:57.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was shot twice from the front,  and thrice from behind.Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.88,0:06:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened  in that room last night, but it was brutal.Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.11,0:06:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,According to forensics,Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.70,0:06:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no evidence any of the locks  in the building were picked.Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.27,0:06:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The crime occurred in a room no one could have entered.Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.69,0:06:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only thing found in the room  was a commonplace mask.Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who? Iceboss?Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.48,0:06:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They said he's unconscious right now.Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.04,0:06:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves him. Why...?Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who're we talking about, Nami-san ?Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.32,0:06:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone who helped us yesterday.Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.42,0:06:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He runs the shipbuilding company and is mayor of Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.25,0:06:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an important individual.Dialogue: 5,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. As far as this city's concerned,Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,news doesn't get any bigger than this. Dialogue: 5,0:06:51.00,0:06:51.95,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go check.Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.27,0:06:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! I'm coming too!Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.76,0:07:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's go look for Robin-chan.Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.03,0:07:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about you?Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.27,0:07:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well,Dialogue: 5,0:07:06.40,0:07:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll watch things play out a little longer.Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.87,0:07:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Extra! Extra! Read all about it!Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.79,0:07:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven's hero, our mayor,  Iceburg-san, has been assassinated!  Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got all the breaking news!Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.47,0:07:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Iceburg-san okay?Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.68,0:07:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.  How could this happen to him?Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.18,0:07:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such a vicious attack. Pirates must've done it!Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like for us to catch them!Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.94,0:07:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There were also some pirates  who raised hell at Dock One yesterday.Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.61,0:07:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Mikazuki gang?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.92,0:07:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suspect the government may be involved. Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.86,0:07:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulu, come again?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.53,0:07:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Corgi. Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.07,0:07:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each time he comes to talk to Iceburg-san,Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.39,0:07:58.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he gets turned away.Dialogue: 5,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky must be the culprit after all.Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.25,0:08:06.21,Main-207+,,200,200,0,,I don't know what his deal was,  but I think Corgi held some undue resentment. Dialogue: 5,0:08:06.21,0:08:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't carp about the government.Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.34,0:08:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If someone hears,  it'll cost you dearly.Dialogue: 5,0:08:13.10,0:08:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the heinous perpetrator's goal? Wealth or power?  Dialogue: 5,0:08:17.18,0:08:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's this assassin  who disappeared without a trace?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:23.19,0:08:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell did it?!  They're gonna pay!Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.24,0:08:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for riding the Puffing Tom.Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.86,0:08:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll soon arrive at Blue Station  in the City of Water, Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.90,0:09:05.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, Paulie-san !Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.57,0:09:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie-san ! Can we get a statement please?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you been told anything?Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.95,0:09:14.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Get out of my way.Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What explanation did the company give you?Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please say something!Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.15,0:09:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf?  I said to get out of my way!Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.75,0:09:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has anything happened that could have  caused someone to target Mr. Iceburg's life?! Dialogue: 5,0:09:25.17,0:09:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything come to mind?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.53,0:09:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any trouble with pirates?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.95,0:09:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Paulie-san ! Tell us... – I said get outta my way!Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dumbasses!Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.30,0:09:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he really was attacked. Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.81,0:09:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We may not even be able to see him at the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.73,0:09:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, let's go to his house.Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.42,0:09:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They said his residence  is in the main office.Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.40,0:09:52.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiwi... Mozu...Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.52,0:09:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I dreamin' this?Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.49,0:09:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ain't, Bro...Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.33,0:10:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is, without a doubt,  where the Franky House stood.Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.91,0:10:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is...Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...just awful.Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.42,0:10:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.76,0:10:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who did this while I was gone?Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.57,0:10:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. It must be them.Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.82,0:10:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you, Straw Hat Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.88,0:10:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I stole his 200 million belly,  and this is how he hit back!Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.75,0:10:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this  to my precious boys?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So cold-blooded...Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no forgivin' this!Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Franky!Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.59,0:10:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're back!Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.88,0:10:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.68,0:11:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys are okay? Good.Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.20,0:11:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was real bad. Those guys were insane!Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.40,0:11:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what,  you gotta make 'em pay,Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.32,0:11:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we've been keeping tabs  on the Straw Hats' movements.Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.15,0:11:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are they?Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.11,0:11:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We saw them going into an inn.Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From there, they headed to Shipyard Island a bit ago.Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.66,0:11:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've gotta be headed to Dock One,  same as yesterday.Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.58,0:11:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. I got it.Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.71,0:11:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy,  prepare for the ass-kicking of your life!Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.49,0:11:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Grandma!Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.65,0:11:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing like crazy!  Hey, Grandma!Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crazy wind! Crazy wind!Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.67,0:12:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Crazy wind! – No need to get all excited.Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.37,0:12:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a southern wind... the caloque, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.69,0:12:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves are getting rough, too.Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.34,0:12:18.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the sea train service will have to be suspended tonight. Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.54,0:12:22.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney! Gonbe!  Get ready to go back to the island!Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.62,0:12:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.67,0:12:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is coming.Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attention, please.Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.83,0:12:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Water Seven Meteorological Agency.Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.79,0:12:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An Aqua Laguna warning  has just been issued for the entire island.Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.63,0:12:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We estimate that it will arrive at Water Seven after midnight tonight.Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.94,0:13:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. It's that time of the year.Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was preoccupied with the Iceburg-san incident.Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.18,0:13:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Aqua Laguna is coming!Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.17,0:13:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure everyone knows!Dialogue: 5,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Work's over for the day!Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.84,0:13:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna?Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that broadcast about?Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.35,0:13:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know? It's–Dialogue: 5,0:13:21.40,0:13:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you an out-of-towner? Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've come at a bad time. Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.87,0:13:27.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.37,0:13:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is, essentially, a storm surge. Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A storm surge, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.83,0:13:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. Make sure you evacuate to high ground.Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.40,0:13:38.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This town will be submerged in the sea.Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The town will be submerged?Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.68,0:13:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's not going to happen right away.Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The forecast said it'll be here about midnight.Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.68,0:13:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, this happens every year. Be careful!Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.35,0:13:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be submerged in the sea?Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.20,0:13:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! This place will sink?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.01,0:14:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it. At any rate,  let's hurry and find Robin-chan.Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.64,0:14:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please tell us something !Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.28,0:14:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Iceburg-san ! – What the hell happened?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't enter, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.44,0:14:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way, we've gotta see Iceboss again somehow.Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.87,0:14:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Do you know  where the entrance to the main office is?Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that ain't happenin'.Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can enter through Dock One,Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.24,0:14:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but only concerned parties and certain reporters are allowed in.Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.76,0:14:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's anxious to find out how he's doing, but we can't do anything.Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.47,0:14:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Thanks.Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.51,0:14:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion? Pretty crowded.Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.94,0:14:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, the bigger the audience, the better.Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.41,0:14:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! This beat... Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.41,0:14:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be... Not him!Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.22,0:15:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why at a time like this?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.71,0:15:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!  Did you just call my name?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.67,0:15:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't! Go away!Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.30,0:15:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where?! Where is he?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.38,0:15:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! He's over there!Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's here!Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.23,0:15:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Come now, don't be shy,  ask me my name! ♪Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.23,0:15:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna! Get lost!Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You attacked Iceburg-san,  didn't you?! Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.61,0:15:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! He did it?! – It's gotta be him!Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.15,0:15:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get off this island!Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.57,0:15:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should be sent to the gallows, punk!Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.62,0:15:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh... shut up, you flies!Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.12,0:15:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ I'm this island's number-one super guy! ♪ Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.29,0:15:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ The face of the Water Seven underworld! ♪Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.63,0:15:47.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!  People call me... Wow!Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.67,0:15:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,Franky!Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.27,0:16:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.21,0:16:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be here, Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.23,0:16:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!  That pervy guy called my name!Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.74,0:16:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't people call him Franky just now?Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.33,0:16:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's him!Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.66,0:16:24.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the one who beat up Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.12,0:16:28.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,...this money belongs to us now.Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.14,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Give it... back.Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.14,0:16:45.02,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Give it baaaaaack!Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.02,0:16:46.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... him!Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.57,0:16:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, bikini bottoms! Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.49,0:16:55.53,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.58,0:17:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no information available?Dialogue: 5,0:17:08.47,0:17:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.46,0:17:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone...Dialogue: 5,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa...Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.64,0:17:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please enter the room... quietly.Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...? Then...!Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.85,0:17:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san...Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.44,0:17:32.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just regained consciousness.Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.07,0:17:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great!Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could leap for joy!Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.80,0:17:45.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry for worrying you.Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm glad you're alive!Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.08,0:17:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please focus on resting up.Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.67,0:17:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of stuff at the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.76,0:17:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, about the culprits  who broke into my room last night...Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.39,0:18:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... they're still investigating.Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I remember it.Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.43,0:18:05.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.41,0:18:06.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.90,0:18:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There were two.  One was a big man wearing a mask.Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other was...Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.95,0:18:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a tall woman with long, black hair.Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.95,0:18:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.  Those black eyes belong to...Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.21,0:18:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san...Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.09,0:18:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san regained consciousness!Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Is that true?! – All right!Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.97,0:18:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Great! – All right!Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.44,0:18:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're the one they call...  Straw Hat Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.32,0:19:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You went on quite the rampage  while I was gone, didn't you?Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.29,0:19:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,When I got back, I couldn't believe my eyes.Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.08,0:19:14.17,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,There was nothing left of my house! Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.17,0:19:18.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And how dare you treat my boys so cruelly?Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.05,0:19:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.39,0:19:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't nobody stoppin' me this week!Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.20,0:19:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing you say will matter.Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.93,0:19:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't calm down  until I rip you to shreds!Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hey, you! – Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.27,0:19:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you!  What'd you do with our 200 million belly?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.03,0:19:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it back to us!Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.61,0:19:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! 200 million belly?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.91,0:19:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already spent it!  It's completely gone!Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.45,0:19:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You obviously stole that money from somewhere.Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.26,0:19:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got no room to get all uppity with me, pirates!Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– It doesn't matter. – Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.59,0:19:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not true! Money does matter!Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.96,0:20:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I won't be happy...Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.47,0:20:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,until I kick your ass!Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph.Dialogue: 5,0:20:05.85,0:20:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I won't be happy, you bastard! Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come down here already!Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.52,0:20:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is it!  Franky's about to rampage!Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.20,0:20:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate! Everyone, evacuate!Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.40,0:20:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.21,0:20:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can breathe fire!Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.89,0:20:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is he?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.67,0:21:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've never seen anyone breathe fire before?Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.95,0:21:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, he might have devil fruit powers.Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.87,0:21:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then... what fruit?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.07,0:21:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with him?  He jumped in the water!Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.31,0:21:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he stupid?  If he ate a devil fruit, he'll drown!Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.68,0:21:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must've slipped and fallen! That's gotta be a fire-breathing power!   Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.41,0:21:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?! He can swim?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.83,0:21:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.37,0:21:56.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't eat no devil fruit!Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.61,0:22:06.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard about your power.Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.93,0:22:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong Right!Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.77,0:22:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.09,0:22:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.59,0:22:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:22:57.81,0:22:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...? What was that?Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.71,0:23:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? You guys didn't know?Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.73,0:23:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll tell you.Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.57,0:23:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a modified human.Dialogue: 5,0:23:12.82,0:23:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a cyborg!Dialogue: 5,0:23:24.25,0:23:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the Straw Hats?Dialogue: 5,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that true?Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.01,0:23:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. My own investigation  led to the same conclusion.Dialogue: 5,0:23:34.01,0:23:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just had Lucci confirm it  with the government. So you see...Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.60,0:23:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. When I contacted the government,Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.85,0:23:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they said she's one of the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 5,0:23:52.91,0:23:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then... they, the Straw Hats,  don't have a leg to stand on.Dialogue: 5,0:23:59.00,0:24:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.84,0:24:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did they do it to get back at us since we wouldn't fix their ship?!Dialogue: 5,0:24:03.81,0:24:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to say.Dialogue: 5,0:24:05.79,0:24:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But no matter the reason,  the truth is we have them dead to rights.Dialogue: 5,0:24:10.41,0:24:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can learn their motive  after they're hogtied.Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.84,0:24:16.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're thinking,Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.51,0:24:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you'll pay for this, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:24:30.82,0:24:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! There's trouble!Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.36,0:24:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're too loud, Tilestone!Dialogue: 5,0:24:36.70,0:24:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How rude! All of you, be quiet!Dialogue: 5,0:24:39.87,0:24:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:24:42.40,0:24:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad you came around!Dialogue: 5,0:24:47.25,0:24:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You yell every damn word you say! Dialogue: 5,0:24:50.76,0:24:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not good for him, got it?!Dialogue: 5,0:24:52.51,0:24:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You're right! I'm sorry!Dialogue: 5,0:24:57.30,0:25:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!  There's trouble! Listen, you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:25:00.18,0:25:02.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't come inside the room.  Speak from where you are.Dialogue: 5,0:25:02.98,0:25:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That pirate Straw Hat from yesterday started a fight with Franky at Dock One,Dialogue: 5,0:25:09.23,0:25:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they're wrecking the shipyard!Dialogue: 5,0:25:16.53,0:25:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 5,0:25:18.62,0:25:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:25:23.16,0:25:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bastard! He's got some nerve  showing his face at the dock! Dialogue: 5,0:25:31.46,0:25:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please get some rest, Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:25:36.97,0:25:40.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be here by your side.Dialogue: 5,0:25:49.52,0:25:51.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 5,0:25:57.07,0:25:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out! It's coming down!Dialogue: 5,0:25:59.24,0:26:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship is breaking apart!Dialogue: 5,0:26:02.41,0:26:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it! This fight is crazy!Dialogue: 5,0:26:10.21,0:26:14.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Beat up that bikini bastard!Dialogue: 5,0:26:14.09,0:26:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 5,0:26:15.72,0:26:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight 'im, yo!Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.60,0:26:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm gonna... send you flying!Dialogue: 5,0:26:32.23,0:26:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead if you can!  Your attacks don't work on me!Dialogue: 5,0:26:47.46,0:26:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 5,0:26:54.46,0:26:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Whip!Dialogue: 5,0:27:06.39,0:27:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?! What happened?!Dialogue: 5,0:27:09.89,0:27:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! That's...!Dialogue: 5,0:27:13.48,0:27:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who was that?!Dialogue: 5,0:27:20.16,0:27:26.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got some gall pulling this crap! What's your goal, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 5,0:27:33.38,0:27:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La... What do you want?Dialogue: 5,0:27:38.51,0:27:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Dock One foremen!Dialogue: 5,0:27:53.10,0:27:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! The foremen are finally here!Dialogue: 5,0:27:57.07,0:28:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close!  The shipyard is practically destroyed!Dialogue: 5,0:28:01.78,0:28:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! The shipwrights we met yesterday! Dialogue: 5,0:28:05.53,0:28:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're on our side, right?Dialogue: 5,0:28:07.08,0:28:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey now, you Galley-La blowhards!Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.04,0:28:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't butt into our fight!Dialogue: 5,0:28:13.46,0:28:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna get hurt?Dialogue: 5,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's amazing you'd say that.Dialogue: 5,0:28:17.71,0:28:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You leveled our factory,Dialogue: 5,0:28:20.17,0:28:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we've gotta make you pay the piper! Dialogue: 5,0:28:23.34,0:28:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right, Franky!  How're you gonna settle this?!Dialogue: 5,0:28:28.11,0:28:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Tilestone.  We'll talk about it later. Dialogue: 5,0:28:32.69,0:28:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have more important business right now.Dialogue: 5,0:28:37.61,0:28:40.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Straw Hat Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:28:40.53,0:28:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talking about.Dialogue: 5,0:28:42.40,0:28:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you'd show your face here again.Dialogue: 5,0:28:45.24,0:28:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Why? We came here because we heard the news about Iceboss.Dialogue: 5,0:28:51.00,0:28:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly, my family wasn't enough,  so you messed with Galley-La too?Dialogue: 5,0:28:56.46,0:29:00.96,Main-207+,,200,200,0,,What, are you just some pubescent punks  who piss on and piss off everyone you come across?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:00.96,0:29:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, we didn't do anything!Dialogue: 5,0:29:04.55,0:29:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Play dumb, and we'll just put the screws to you!Dialogue: 5,0:29:08.51,0:29:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action Half-Knot!Dialogue: 5,0:29:13.94,0:29:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe. I can't breathe!Dialogue: 5,0:29:17.61,0:29:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Air... Drive!Dialogue: 5,0:29:23.53,0:29:28.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards! I said don't interfere!  Don't you get it?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:28.03,0:29:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the one with a grudge against him!Dialogue: 5,0:29:35.21,0:29:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:29:36.46,0:29:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat 'em up, Galley-La Company!Dialogue: 5,0:29:39.30,0:29:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The company's furious five are fighting!Dialogue: 5,0:29:41.84,0:29:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Why are the shipwrights fighting us too?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:45.47,0:29:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's heatin' up.Dialogue: 5,0:29:50.14,0:29:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! I haven't got  the slightest reason to fight you guys! Dialogue: 5,0:30:00.19,0:30:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's... got devil fruit powers?Dialogue: 5,0:30:14.66,0:30:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you bastards even listening?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:20.34,0:30:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said...Dialogue: 5,0:30:24.80,0:30:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's my prey!Dialogue: 5,0:30:31.80,0:30:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:30:35.35,0:30:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time  to trifle with you, Franky!Dialogue: 5,0:30:38.98,0:30:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say, you wild monkey?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:42.61,0:30:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's interfering, Franky! Dialogue: 5,0:30:50.03,0:30:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our Tilestone!  He's as mighty as ever!Dialogue: 5,0:31:02.25,0:31:05.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:31:09.68,0:31:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Stop it!Dialogue: 5,0:31:29.24,0:31:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys are tough!Dialogue: 5,0:31:31.20,0:31:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's with you?!  At least tell me why you're doing this!Dialogue: 5,0:31:40.29,0:31:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, we're the ones  who'd like to know why.Dialogue: 5,0:31:46.71,0:31:53.01,Main-207+,,200,200,0,,Last night, intruders broke into our main office  and attacked Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:31:53.01,0:31:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was you guys! Admit it!Dialogue: 5,0:31:54.64,0:31:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't be... This can't be...Dialogue: 5,0:31:58.06,0:32:00.77,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,They actually messed with my fight.Dialogue: 5,0:32:23.42,0:32:28.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That was... without a doubt, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:32:28.34,0:32:32.63,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that big guy with her  also one of the Straw Hats?Dialogue: 5,0:32:32.63,0:32:36.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did they attack me  in the first place?Dialogue: 5,0:32:36.69,0:32:40.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to imagine that they  did it as payback for yesterday.Dialogue: 5,0:32:40.06,0:32:43.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,They must be after  something of mine.Dialogue: 5,0:32:43.27,0:32:47.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, are those pirates  connected to the government?Dialogue: 5,0:32:47.69,0:32:50.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Or were they after "that" all along?Dialogue: 5,0:32:52.49,0:32:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 5,0:32:55.66,0:32:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Breaking news! Breaking news!Dialogue: 5,0:32:58.24,0:33:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From what Iceburg-san said,  the culprits have been identified!Dialogue: 5,0:33:02.41,0:33:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that true?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:03.92,0:33:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let the entire city know immediately and corner them!Dialogue: 5,0:33:07.46,0:33:10.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them leave Water Seven!Dialogue: 5,0:33:10.39,0:33:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capture them!Dialogue: 5,0:33:13.93,0:33:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The culprits who attacked Mr. Iceburg are...Dialogue: 5,0:33:19.81,0:33:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 5,0:33:26.73,0:33:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg was attacked?  What're you talking about?Dialogue: 5,0:33:34.03,0:33:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do they mean?Dialogue: 5,0:33:38.45,0:33:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D... Don't be ridiculous! Why...  Why would we do such a thing?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:43.66,0:33:50.46,Main-207+,,200,200,0,,When Iceburg-san came around,  he told us that he remembered the two who did it.Dialogue: 5,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One was a big man wearing a mask.Dialogue: 5,0:33:53.97,0:33:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other was a tall woman.Dialogue: 5,0:33:57.18,0:34:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we asked the government,  they confirmed her affiliation with you:Dialogue: 5,0:34:03.93,0:34:06.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, the woman  with a bounty on her head!Dialogue: 5,0:34:08.06,0:34:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:13.82,0:34:19.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was coming to this island all just a plot to kill Iceburg-san ? Dialogue: 5,0:34:19.28,0:34:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or did you decide to do it  after you guys met him yesterday?Dialogue: 5,0:34:24.70,0:34:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you pirates think...Dialogue: 5,0:34:29.04,0:34:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but since we know you're guilty,  there's no way you walk free.Dialogue: 5,0:34:33.59,0:34:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he's one of the culprits?Dialogue: 5,0:34:36.01,0:34:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't forgive him!  We definitely can't!Dialogue: 5,0:34:38.63,0:34:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 5,0:34:39.76,0:34:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, hey, did Iceburg die or not?Dialogue: 5,0:34:43.68,0:34:47.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if a bunch of halfwits  could even kill him.Dialogue: 5,0:34:47.64,0:34:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as this punk lives, he could go after Iceburg-san again.Dialogue: 5,0:34:53.61,0:34:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we'll take care  of him right here, right now.Dialogue: 5,0:34:59.91,0:35:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It says "dead or alive."Dialogue: 5,0:35:02.24,0:35:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They want you either way. Dialogue: 5,0:35:04.91,0:35:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know what it means  to be a wanted man?Dialogue: 5,0:35:07.79,0:35:12.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pirates can't complain,  no matter who does what to you.Dialogue: 5,0:35:12.63,0:35:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, the world's laws  won't protect you guys.Dialogue: 5,0:35:17.13,0:35:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 5,0:35:19.72,0:35:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're outlaws.Dialogue: 5,0:35:22.89,0:35:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that. But...Dialogue: 5,0:35:25.68,0:35:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,don't talk crap about Robin  when you know nothing about her!Dialogue: 5,0:35:31.15,0:35:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 5,0:35:32.86,0:35:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me see Iceboss!Dialogue: 5,0:35:34.77,0:35:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's mistaken!  There's no way it was Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:35:37.82,0:35:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would we let you get closer  when we can't ascertain your intentions?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:43.49,0:35:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right! Tie 'em up!Dialogue: 5,0:35:46.49,0:35:49.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They tried to kill our hero!Dialogue: 5,0:35:49.37,0:35:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send them to the gallows!Dialogue: 5,0:35:51.87,0:35:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! What're you saying?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:55.10,0:35:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bitch!Dialogue: 5,0:35:57.51,0:36:01.59,Main-207+,,200,200,0,,Hey! You were with that Straw Hat guy earlier,  weren't you?Dialogue: 5,0:36:01.59,0:36:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be one of them, too!Dialogue: 5,0:36:03.43,0:36:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that right?!Dialogue: 5,0:36:04.71,0:36:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right! I saw her too!Dialogue: 5,0:36:08.45,0:36:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let you get away!Dialogue: 5,0:36:10.18,0:36:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop resisting!Dialogue: 5,0:36:12.79,0:36:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!Dialogue: 5,0:36:15.40,0:36:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 5,0:36:17.11,0:36:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The news is already  making its way through the city.Dialogue: 5,0:36:20.36,0:36:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to run!Dialogue: 5,0:36:22.88,0:36:26.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll bring down each and every one of you! Dialogue: 5,0:36:26.45,0:36:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Extra! Extra!Dialogue: 5,0:36:28.66,0:36:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates are the prime suspects  in the attempt on Mr. Iceburg's life! Dialogue: 5,0:36:34.42,0:36:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We at the Hydro City Sentinel will pay  for any information on their whereabouts!Dialogue: 5,0:36:42.13,0:36:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The culprits are on this island!Dialogue: 5,0:36:46.39,0:36:51.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find the Straw Hats and  send them all to the gallows!Dialogue: 5,0:36:51.93,0:36:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg Falls Victim to AssassinDialogue: 1,0:02:29.75,0:02:34.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,Back Alley, Water SevenDialogue: 2,0:02:29.75,0:02:34.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,Back Alley, Water SevenDialogue: 1,0:02:38.60,0:02:43.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Roof of an Inn Back AlleyDialogue: 2,0:02:38.60,0:02:43.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Roof of an Inn Back AlleyDialogue: 1,0:07:22.17,0:07:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg Falls Victim to AssassinDialogue: 1,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shift StationDialogue: 2,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shift StationDialogue: 1,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,North of Water SevenDialogue: 2,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,North of Water SevenDialogue: 1,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Franky Franky Family Boss Dismantler and Bounty HunterDialogue: 2,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Franky Franky Family Boss Dismantler and Bounty HunterDialogue: 1,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.71,Sign-Reporters,,0,0,0,,He regained consciousnessDialogue: 1,0:19:06.37,0:19:14.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Kiwi (Left) and Mozu (Right) The Square Sisters The Franky FamilyDialogue: 2,0:19:06.37,0:19:14.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Kiwi (Left) and Mozu (Right) The Square Sisters The Franky FamilyDialogue: 0,0:24:39.95,0:24:45.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tilestone Joinery, Caulking, and Sailmaking Foreman Dock OneDialogue: 1,0:24:39.95,0:24:45.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Tilestone Joinery, Caulking, and Sailmaking Foreman Dock OneDialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 1,0:00:04.03,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 1,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in